# Vivi Ornitier, "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Vivi Ornitier and it deals 1 damage to
# each opponent." A creature spell (Blazing Rootwalla) does nothing to it. A Lightning Bolt does, and Bot2 counters the
# Bolt in response: the trigger resolves ahead of the spell and regardless of what becomes of it, so the counter and the
# one damage are there while the Bolt is in the graveyard unresolved and Bot2 is still at 19.

